OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowery
OL,6,Frain, locally heavy and thundery at
OL,7,Ftimes, spreads north. Elsewhere,
OL,8,Fshowers mostly fade with a few fog
OL,9,Fpatches developing. Further heavy,
OL,10,Fthundery rain reaches southern and
OL,11,Fsouthwestern England later, edging
OL,12,Fnorthwards. Warm and humid conditions
OL,13,Fcontinue for many areas.
OL,14,
OL,15,CThursday:FBands of heavy rain and
OL,16,Fthunderstorms slowly moving northwards
OL,17,Facross England and Wales, sunnier
OL,18,Fskies following from the southeast.
OL,19,FBright spells for Scotland and
OL,20,FNorthern Ireland, with scattered
OL,21,Fshowers. Warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
